WEBVTT

00:05.800 --> 00:09.840
I will draft an edict to depose the Crown Prince to satisfy them.

00:11.480 --> 00:12.880
All dismissed for now.

00:14.280 --> 00:15.947
Let me have some peace.

00:21.800 --> 00:23.200
Yes.

00:56.240 --> 00:58.800
Ruolan.

01:07.600 --> 01:11.920
Fan Zhong have Marquis of Yongning guard the empress's tomb Your Majesty.

01:12.000 --> 01:14.333
Your servant Xie Xuan requests an audience.

01:41.680 --> 01:45.587
In the future, Great Xuan will be restored lost territories will be recovered.

01:46.440 --> 01:51.280
In the history books not only brother-in-law not only sister.

01:52.520 --> 01:55.853
There will also be a record of me, Xie Xuan.

02:00.800 --> 02:04.200
Fan Zhong bring me a jug of wine.

02:22.120 --> 02:26.760
The 21st year of Longwu Xie Xuan was executed by Emperor Sikong Yao.

02:26.840 --> 02:31.800
On charges of persecuting loyal officials in the capital at the same time.

02:31.920 --> 02:36.600
The emperor also ordered the Crown Prince to be confined to the palace.

02:40.120 --> 02:42.840
Time is up execute.

02:43.760 --> 02:45.160
Brother-in-law.

02:47.240 --> 02:52.600
Speaking of defeat before the battle staying in the capital has made your bones soft.

02:55.520 --> 02:58.720
Since we must fight to the death I won't be such a coward.

03:01.760 --> 03:06.987
Brother-in-law I request to lead the cavalry out of the city you, as a Xuan person.

03:07.800 --> 03:13.800
Acting as a dog under the enemy's tent Xie Xuan, deputy general of Yiyang garrison kill him.

03:16.720 --> 03:21.520
One day give me one more day I will personally lead the battle.

03:21.920 --> 03:25.693
Under my command there are also over a hundred men.

03:33.280 --> 03:35.840
To clear the way for Your Highness.

03:40.000 --> 03:55.000
And this bought sufficient time for the imperial court, holding out until troops were led back to the capital to quell the rebellion.

04:02.880 --> 04:03.800
General Zu.

04:03.880 --> 04:07.027
Please rise quickly you've worked hard, General Zu.

04:09.880 --> 04:11.760
I will reward you heavily.

04:12.600 --> 04:14.000
Read.

04:15.240 --> 04:17.520
General of Agile Cavalry Zu Yue.

04:17.800 --> 04:22.560
Loyalty and courage bestowed by heaven meritorious achievements are clear rescued the emperor and quelled rebellion.

04:22.640 --> 04:26.640
Merits surpass all officials now specially promoted to Grand General.

04:27.040 --> 04:31.480
Envoy with credentials, bearer of yellow battle-axe Commander of all military affairs.

04:31.800 --> 04:36.560
Granted the nine bestowments and special honors may enter court without hurrying addressed without name.

04:36.640 --> 04:41.360
May enter court with sword and shoes opened a government office equal to the Three Excellencies.

04:46.200 --> 04:49.160
Your servant Zu Yue kowtows in gratitude for the imperial grace.

